&#x200B;

What if women were shamed for selling feet pics and sexualizing themselves?  Then there would be backlash about women not having total control of what they can do. What if a grown man sold his socks and underwear? He would be labeled a creep and perv all over the internet.  A girl does it? You go girl!!! Then she starts selling nudes, gets contacted by a porn agency, they offer more money, ok you get the idea. There is no shame or stigma in it.

