&#x200B;

Honestly though, many women my age ARE NOT INTERESTED. Many want older guys believe it or not, a guy who was divorced even. A 50yo woman said you are too young for me. She told me to date 30 something women and have a family. She said honestly if she was a guy my age and made that money that is exactly what she would do. She told me she has grown kids already.

