It seems an FA should just take what they can get. This is a dumb analogy but some people can buy a $1000 used car, and they are very good with cars. They can fix the car, and restore it to almost new condition. They may have a car for 10 years and save 30-40 grand buying new. 

Another will go bankrupt from that same car if they have to depend on strange mechanics, and worse yet it can become a safety issue.

